        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void Supercluster.KDTree.BoundedPriorityList&lt; TElement &gt;.Add</definition>
        <argsstring>(TElement item, double priority)</argsstring>
        <name>Add</name>
        <qualifiedname>Supercluster.KDTree.BoundedPriorityList-1-g.Add</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>TElement</type>
          <declname>item</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>double</type>
          <declname>priority</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Attempts to add the provided <emphasis>item</emphasis> . If the list is currently at maximum capacity and the elements priority is greater than or equal to the highest priority, the <emphasis>item</emphasis>  is not inserted. If the <emphasis>item</emphasis>  is eligible for insertion, the upon insertion the <emphasis>item</emphasis>  that previously had the largest priority is removed from the list. This is an O(log n) operation. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>item</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The item to be inserted</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>priority</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The priority of th given item.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
